@startuml dependency-handoff
!include state-machine-style.iuml
title Slop Machine | Scope blocker and durable dependency handoff

state "Contain scope drift\nStop/fence implementation\nKeep only handoff actions permitted" as Contain
state OriginalTracking <<choice>>
state "Establish original Jira ticket for prompt task\nCreate or reconcile by stable origin identity\nPreserve request, clarifications, scope + work history\nVerify link to internal task before prerequisite" as PromotePrompt
state "Record bounded proposal\nProblem, evidence, scope boundary,\nsolution, criteria and exclusions" as Proposal
state "Create or find prerequisite ticket\nReconcile by operation identity\nCheck duplicates and dependency cycles" as Prerequisite
state HasChanges <<choice>>
state "Preserve task changes\nCommit to dedicated task branch\nPush + verify exact remote commit" as Preserve
state "Record unchanged base\nNo dummy commit needed" as Base
state "Link + update original ticket\nBlocked by prerequisite; branch/commit;\ncompleted work, remaining work, checks" as Update
state "Confirm handoff\nVerify original + prerequisite links and remote work\nMark original ticket blocked; sync internal task if present" as Confirm
state "Blocked and preserved\nEnd old run; stop sessions; release slot" as Blocked <<blocked>>
state "Reconcile failed/unknown step\nInspect Jira and remote state\nNever blindly recreate or repush" as Reconcile <<attention>>
state "Resume first incomplete step\nDispatch only after fresh checks" as Resume
state "Handoff incomplete\nImplementation remains stopped\nPersist recovery action; end run" as Incomplete <<attention>>

[*] --> Contain
Contain --> OriginalTracking : implementation stopped/fenced
OriginalTracking --> Proposal : [original Jira ticket linked]
OriginalTracking --> PromotePrompt : [prompt-only; internal tracking]
PromotePrompt --> Proposal : original Jira ticket + internal link verified
PromotePrompt --> Reconcile : failed or ambiguous original-ticket creation
Proposal --> Prerequisite : proposal recorded; policy permits
Prerequisite --> HasChanges : ticket verified; no cycle
HasChanges --> Preserve : [task has code changes]
HasChanges --> Base : [no changes]
Preserve --> Update : remote commit verified
Base --> Update : base evidence recorded
Update --> Confirm : dependency + handoff details verified
Confirm --> Blocked : all steps confirmed
Prerequisite --> Reconcile : failed or ambiguous outcome
Preserve --> Reconcile : failed or ambiguous outcome
Update --> Reconcile : failed or ambiguous outcome
Confirm --> Reconcile : incomplete confirmation
Reconcile --> Resume : retry permitted; outcome known\nand recovery budget remains
Resume --> Prerequisite : [prerequisite step incomplete]
Resume --> PromotePrompt : [original-ticket step incomplete]
Resume --> Preserve : [preservation step incomplete]
Resume --> Update : [ticket-link/update step incomplete]
Resume --> Confirm : [confirmation step incomplete]
Reconcile --> Incomplete : unresolved effects, permission failure,\ncycle, or exhausted recovery
Prerequisite --> Incomplete : dependency cycle cannot be resolved
Blocked --> [*] : return dependency_blocked
Incomplete --> [*] : return attention

note right of Preserve
  Preservation is not approved delivery.
  Incomplete or failing code is labeled as such.
  Publish only this task's intended files;
  never main, credentials, or unrelated work.
end note
note bottom of Blocked
  No arrow back into the old implementation loop.
  After the prerequisite is resolved, the scheduler may create a NEW run.
  New preflight verifies the fix in current code and reconciles preserved work.
  New implementer/reviewer sessions; new checks and new approval.
end note
note left of Reconcile
  Each side effect has its own operation ID.
  Track step outcomes independently.
  Redelivery must not duplicate tickets.
  Stop implementation even if Jira is unavailable.
end note
note left of PromotePrompt
  A prompt can start without a user-written ticket.
  FR-10 requires an original Jira ticket to block and link;
  promotion is conditional, only when a prompt-only task
  reaches this handoff. Do not create the prerequisite until
  original-ticket creation and origin linkage are confirmed.
  Ambiguous creation is reconciled before retry to avoid duplicates.
  The task retains its prompt origin and internal task ID.
end note
@enduml
